ts in the park to make it look  that little bit further away and a  little bit like it's sitting on the  larger rock than it really is this is  just a very quick look at what this  thing looks like right now it's not that  much I was kind of hoping to get more  stuff done in this episode but well  lately I've just been strolling quite a  bit things have been taking a bit longer  than I expected which isn't necessarily  an issue as long as I can still push it  before of where three comes around and  it's been nice to work on it so far  anyway so that doesn't really matter  but I am kind of behind schedule so that  serves something to note here and I've  also started work on the new part of the  park which actually took a fair amount  of time it won't be included in any of  the time lapses just the simple station  for the monorail which I'm working on  right now which I'll continue work on in  the next episode and that should be  parts of the finalizing of the German  area the German area is quite simple and  it's supposed to be like an area that  could be very small theme park just in  it's very starting phase in the way that  it's laid out so I do want it to be  quite closed and have only one or two  entrances into different parts of the  park and this is more or less the layout  of the German area a bit of work that I  still need to do is on the monorail  station and adding some buildings on the  side here with some kind of connection  into what it's going to be the Dutch  area and something along the ring that I  have over here which I'm not really sure  what I'm actually gonna do with it  same goes for this little area which may  very well become a nice entrance into  the Scandinavian kind of earlier which I  still have to figure out over here and  obviously this ride and all the scenery  around it's basically still needs to be  finished so yeah that stuff that you'll  see me doing and then in the next  episode which is going to be well quite  a bit messy since i